page('find-care','Find hymenoplasty information in Canada','Browse independent public hymenoplasty provider research in Ontario and Québec.',intro('CANADIAN PROVIDER RESEARCH','Explore care in Canada.','A starting point for your own research, with clear boundaries about what a listing means.')+'''<section class="wrap directory"><div class="directory-intro"><p>These providers publish hymenoplasty information on their own websites. Listings are not referrals, endorsements, or evidence of a partnership. We have not independently verified clinicians’ registration, outcomes, current availability, or suitability for you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/consultation-guide/">What to check before booking ↗</a></div><div class="city-guide-links"><a class="text-link" href="/cities/">Browse all city guides</a><a class="text-link" href="/toronto/">Toronto & GTA guide ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/montreal/">Montréal & Westmount guide ↗</a></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter providers by region"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All locations</button><button class="filter" data-filter="ontario" aria-pressed="false">Ontario</button><button class="filter" data-filter="quebec" aria-pressed="false">Québec</button><button class="filter" data-filter="other" aria-pressed="false">Elsewhere in Canada</button></div><p id="results-count" class="fine" role="status" aria-live="polite">4 public listings</p><div class="provider-list">'''+cards+'''</div><div id="no-providers" class="empty-state" hidden><p class="eyebrow">A DIFFERENT STARTING POINT</p><h2>No researched listings in this region yet.</h2><p>This does not mean care is unavailable. Speak with a local primary care clinician or gynaecologist about specialist assessment. If you consider travel, ask about follow-up and care close to home.</p>'''+link('/consultation-guide/','Prepare for a consultation','text-link')+'''</div><div class="callout"><h2>Verify the person, not just the website.</h2><p>Ask for the treating clinician’s full name and registration number. Confirm their registration with the medical regulator in the province where treatment will happen. Discuss relevant experience, facility arrangements, aftercare, and the full cost directly.</p><p>External websites have their own privacy practices. We do not send your selections or enquiry information when you open a listing.</p></div></section>'''+cta(),'care')

