page('consultation-guide','Your consultation checklist','A practical checklist for discussing hymenoplasty and intimate procedures with a clinician in Canada.',intro('YOUR CONSULTATION','Good questions.<br>A clearer conversation.','Bring this checklist to your appointment. You can ask for time, explanations, and a second opinion.')+f'<section class="wrap checklist-layout"><aside><p>This checklist is for your preparation. Ticks stay in this page only and are not submitted.</p><button class="button" id="print-checklist">Print checklist <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button class="text-link reset-checks" type="button">Clear all ticks</button><p id="check-progress" role="status" class="fine">0 of 12 questions checked</p></aside><div>{checks}</div></section>'+cta(),'guide')

page('about','About hymen.ca','Our independent role in information and enquiry preparation for intimate procedures in Canada.',intro('OUR ROLE','A thoughtful place<br>to begin.','Clear information can make a personal decision feel less overwhelming.')+'''<section class="wrap about-layout"><div class="about-photo"><img src="/assets/rose-anatomy-hero.jpg" alt="Abstract rose-coloured layered illustration inspired by vulval anatomy" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"></div><article class="prose"><p>This website is operated by Hymen.ca Inc.</p><h2>Information with perspective.</h2><p>hymen.ca is an independent information and enquiry resource for adults in Canada exploring hymenoplasty and related intimate procedures. It is not a medical clinic and does not provide diagnosis, treatment, or a clinician’s assessment.</p><h2>Your choice deserves context.</h2><p>We explain terminology, link to source material, and encourage questions about evidence, costs, risks, and alternatives. We do not use patient testimonials, before-and-after images, or promises of a particular result.</p><h2>Transparent about our role.</h2><p>Provider links are based on public websites and do not imply a partnership. Consultation requests are sent to the hymen.ca form account through Formspree; listed providers are not automatically sent your details.</p><p>Our educational content is a sourced summary, not a medical review by our own clinical team.</p>'''+link('/sources/','See our sources & editorial approach','text-link')+'''</article></section>''','about')

source_rows=''.join(f'<li><a href="{url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{label} ↗</a></li>' for key,(label,url) in SOURCES.items() if key not in ['tcc','danino'])
page('sources','Sources & editorial approach','The sources and editorial principles behind hymen.ca patient information.',intro('READ BEYOND THE HEADLINE','Our sources.<br>Our approach.','Primary guidance and patient information, with clear distinctions between clinical evidence and provider advertising.')+'''<section class="wrap narrow prose"><h2>How to read this website</h2><p>We summarise patient information in plain language and place source links beside medical claims. Guidelines and professional statements provide context for evidence and limitations. Provider websites establish that a service is publicly described; their marketing is not proof of safety, effectiveness, credentials, or current availability.</p><p>The SOGC guideline and ACOG opinion were accessed through their PubMed abstracts. We do not claim access to their paywalled full text. International patient resources inform general explanations, not Canadian prices, insurance rules, or regulatory status.</p><h2>Clinical and patient references</h2><ul class="source-list">'''+source_rows+'''</ul><h2>Public provider research</h2><p>The <a href="/find-care/">provider directory</a> links directly to the four public pages checked for this build. Published claims vary and should be verified with the treating clinician.</p><h2>Editorial principles</h2><ul><li>Use medically accurate terms and acknowledge normal anatomical variation.</li><li>Explain material risks and uncertainty without shame or pressure.</li><li>Do not promise bleeding, restored virginity, improved sexual function, or a guaranteed match.</li><li>Separate educational information from any individual treatment recommendation.</li></ul><p class="fine">Sources checked: 8 September 2026. The website has not undergone an independent clinical review.</p></section>''')

page('privacy','Privacy & your information','How consultation requests and browsing information are handled.',intro('YOUR INFORMATION','Know what happens<br>before you share.','Understand what you send and how your consultation request is handled.')+'''<section class="wrap narrow prose"><h2>Website operator</h2><p>This website is operated by Hymen.ca Inc.</p><h2>Reading the guides</h2><p>You can read the website without submitting personal information. The site does not use advertising pixels, analytics or session replay.</p><h2>Sending a consultation request</h2><p>When you submit, your chosen topic, location, name, email, optional phone number, permissions and page language are sent to Formspree for the hymen.ca form account. Formspree processes the submission and delivers notifications according to that account’s settings.</p><p>Provide only contact details and your general area of interest. Do not send medical records, photographs or intimate history through this form.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Contact consent is required to send a request. Voicemail permission is optional and separate. No marketing consent is requested. Ask the team replying to your enquiry to stop contacting you or to address questions about your submitted information.</p><h2>Storage and external services</h2><p>This site does not save form entries in cookies, local storage or page URLs. Successful submission clears the form. With JavaScript enabled, unsent entries are cleared when you leave the page; your browser may separately offer autofill. Submitted records are managed through the Formspree account and its configured recipients, not erased by clearing this page.</p><p>Provider links take you to independent websites with their own privacy practices. Opening a provider link does not send your form entries.</p></section>''')

province_options=''.join(f'<option>{p}</option>' for p in ['Alberta','British Columbia','Manitoba','New Brunswick','Newfoundland and Labrador','Northwest Territories','Nova Scotia','Nunavut','Ontario','Prince Edward Island','Québec','Saskatchewan','Yukon'])
page('enquiry','Request a consultation','Prepare a consultation request about hymenoplasty and intimate procedures.',intro('YOUR CONSULTATION REQUEST','Let’s talk about<br>what matters to you.','We understand that intimate care can be difficult to talk about. Start with a general area of interest and a way to reach you. You do not need to explain your personal history.')+'''<section class="wrap enquiry-layout"><aside class="enquiry-aside"><p class="eyebrow">AT YOUR OWN PACE</p><h2>Your questions.<br>Your next step.</h2><p>Your request goes to hymen.ca through Formspree. The team can contact you to discuss your enquiry; submitting does not confirm a surgeon, appointment or treatment.</p><p>Please do not include medical records, photographs or intimate history. This form is not for urgent medical concerns.</p><a href="/privacy/" class="text-link">How your information is handled ↗</a></aside><div class="enquiry-panel"><p class="phone-contact">Prefer to call? <a href="tel:+18336969996">(833) 696-9996</a></p><form id="consultation-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/myeyblnr" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Consultation request — hymen.ca"><input type="hidden" name="language" value="en-CA"><div class="form-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this field empty</label><input id="website" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><h2>Your consultation request</h2><div class="discretion-note"><h3>Your privacy matters.</h3><p>Choose “I’m not sure yet” if you prefer to begin with a general conversation. A phone number is optional, and voicemail permission is your choice.</p><p>Only share contact details you are comfortable using for a reply. Your request is sent through Formspree; read how your information is handled before submitting.</p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">Privacy & your information</a></div><p>Fields marked * are required.</p><label class="field-label" for="topic">Area of interest *</label><select id="topic" name="topic" required><option value="">Choose one topic</option><option>Hymenoplasty</option><option>Labiaplasty</option><option>Perineoplasty & pelvic health</option>'''+''.join('<option>'+name+'</option>' for _,name,*_ in service_topics)+'''<option>I’m not sure yet</option></select><div class="contact-grid"><div><label class="field-label" for="province">Province or territory *</label><select id="province" name="province" required><option value="">Select a province or territory</option>'''+province_options+'''</select></div><div><label class="field-label" for="city">City *</label><input id="city" name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="120" required></div></div><label class="field-label" for="contact-name">Preferred name *</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" autocomplete="given-name" maxlength="100" required><label class="field-label" for="email">Email address *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" aria-describedby="email-note" required><p class="fine" id="email-note">Use an email address where you are comfortable receiving a reply about your request.</p><label class="field-label" for="phone">Phone number (optional)</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="40" aria-describedby="phone-note"><p id="phone-note" class="fine">If you provide a phone number, the team may call. Without voicemail permission, ask them to follow up by email if you miss the call.</p><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" name="voicemail_permission" value="yes"><span>You may leave a voicemail about my request.</span></label><label class="check-item age-check"><input type="checkbox" name="adult_confirmation" value="18_or_older" required><span>I am 18 or older.</span></label><label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" name="contact_consent" value="yes" required><span>I agree that hymen.ca may use these details to contact me about this request. The form is processed by Formspree.</span></label><p class="fine">Consent is for this enquiry, not marketing. You can ask the responding team to stop contacting you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">Privacy & your information</a><p id="submission-error" class="form-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p><div class="form-buttons"><button class="button" id="send-request" type="submit">Send consultation request <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><button class="text-link" type="reset">Clear form</button></div></form><section id="submission-success" tabindex="-1" role="status" hidden><p class="eyebrow">REQUEST RECEIVED</p><h2>Thank you for reaching out.</h2><p>Your request was accepted by our form service. It is not an appointment confirmation. Please wait for a reply before making any treatment or travel arrangements.</p>'''+link('/consultation-guide/','Prepare your consultation questions','text-link')+'''</section></div></section>''')


comparison_data = [
 ('hymenoplasty','Hymenoplasty','Hymenal tissue at the vaginal opening.','Surgical reconstruction or alteration of hymenal tissue.','It cannot restore virginity or establish sexual history. Bleeding is not guaranteed.','Ask for individual recovery instructions, activity restrictions, and a follow-up plan.','“What can this procedure realistically change, and what outcomes can you not promise?”',['who','tcc','danino']),
 ('labiaplasty','Labiaplasty','The labia, usually the inner folds of the vulva.','Reduction or reshaping of labial tissue.','Normal labia vary. Surgery does not guarantee improved body confidence or satisfaction.','Time away from work and full healing are different. Ask about exercise, intercourse, and managing discomfort.','“Is my anatomy within normal variation, and could my discomfort have another cause?”',['nhs']),
 ('perineoplasty','Perineoplasty','The perineum, between the vaginal opening and anus.','Repair or alteration of perineal tissue, sometimes after childbirth-related changes.','It is different from surgery on the internal vaginal canal. Symptoms need assessment before choosing a procedure.','Ask about pelvic health assessment, non-surgical alternatives, and a tailored recovery plan.','“What is causing my symptoms, and would non-surgical care be appropriate first?”',['cleveland']),
]
